permissive kernel
allow kernel * * *
allow system_server kernel fd use
allow system_server kernel fifo_file { read write open getattr }
allow system_server kernel binder { call transfer }
allow system_server devpts chr_file { read write open ioctl getattr }
allow system_server devpts fd use
allow servicemanager kernel dir { search read open getattr }
allow servicemanager proc dir { search read open getattr }
allow servicemanager kernel process getattr
allow servicemanager proc process getattr
allow servicemanager kernel file { read open getattr }
allow servicemanager proc file { read open getattr }
